the modport.
Consider a scenario in which a modport gmu is defined in the myintf interface. In the
following example, modportinst1 is an instance of the gmu modport and modportinst[2]
is an array of the modport:
Example 1 Array of Modports
interface myintf();
logic enable;
logic cnt;
modport gmu (output enable, input cnt);
endinterface

module mod (myintf.gmu modportinst[2], myintf.gmu modportinst1);
$display("Toggle Coverage for Modport Arrays\n");
end
myintf inst1 [2] ();
assign inst1[0].enable = 1'b1;
#1 inst1[0].cnt = 1'b0;
#1 inst1[1].cnt = 1'b0;
#2 inst1[0].cnt = 1'b1;
#2 inst1[1].cnt = 1'b1;
#3 inst1[0].cnt = 1'b0;
end

mod mod_inst(inst1, inst1[0]);
