The set Type Attribute
HVP
Consider the following HVP file, spec.hvp, which shows the definition of the set type
attribute, my_set and six features (f1, f2, f3, f4, f5, and f6) that contains different values
of the attribute:
plan top;
attribute set{S0,S1,S2,S_other} my_set = {s0};
feature f1;
my_set = {};
feature f2;
my_set = {S0};
feature f3;
my_set = {S0,S0};
feature f4;
my_set = {S1,S2};
feature f5;
my_set = {S2,S1};
feature f6;
my_set = {S0,S1,S2,S_other};
