Support for uwire Built-in Net Type
VCS supports uwire net type as specified in IEEE 1800-2017, Section 6.6.2 Unresolved
nets. You can enable this support by using the -uwire_to_wire compile time option.
Use the following option at compile time:
% vcs -sverilog test.v -uwire_to_wire
The following is a code snippet of uwire net type that is supported:
Example 60 unwire net type
module test( output uwire [15:0] out1, input uwire [15:0]
in1, input uwire [3:0] in2 );
assign out1 = in1 >> in2;
The limitations of this feature are as follows:
• Error is not issued for multiple drivers on uwire net.
• Port connections with dissimilar net types are not supported.
